ul>\r\n','Developpeur','day_man','fr'),(283,147,'Newsletter','<ul>\r\n	<li>Sending platform: Selection and setup of the newsletter sending system</li>\r\n	<li>Database management: Creation and segmentation of contacts</li>\r\n	<li>Content and design: Designing templates and writing impactful messages</li>\r\n	<li>Sending and reporting: Managing mailings and analyzing performance (open rates, clicks)</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n','developer','man/day','en'),(284,147,'Newsletter','<ul>\r\n	<li>Plateforme d&#39;envoi : Choix et configuration du syst&egrave;me d&#39;envoi de newsletters.</li>\r\n	<li>Gestion de la base de donn&eacute;es : Cr&eacute;ation et segmentation des contacts.</li>\r\n	<li>Contenu et design : Conception de maquettes et r&eacute;daction de messages impactants.</li>\r\n	<li>Envoi et reporting : Gestion des envois et analyse des performances (taux d&#39;ouverture, clics).</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n','Developpeur','Mois','fr'),(285,148,'Content Writing','<ul>\r\n	<li>Definition of channel and objective: Choice of medium (blog articles, website, social media, video scripts, press releases) and setting the goal for each content piece</li>\r\n	<li>Research and positioning: Analysis of the target audience and competitors to determine tone and message</li>\r\n	<li>Writing and optimization: Creating engaging and relevant content, including keyword integration (for web) or visual/audio elements (for videos)</li>\r\n	<li>Revision and validation: Proofreading, corrections, and adjustments to ensure final content quality</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n','developer','man/day','en'),(286,148,'RÃ©daction de contenu','<ul>\r\n	<li>D&eacute;finition du canal et de l&#39;objectif : Choix du support (articles de blog, site web, r&eacute;seaux sociaux, script vid&eacute;o, communiqu&eacute; de presse) et d&eacute;finition de l&#39;objectif de chaque contenu.</li>\r\n	<li>Recherche et positionnement : Analyse du public cible et de la concurrence pour d&eacute;terminer le ton et le message.</li>\r\n	<li