tive</li>\r\n	<li>&bull; Producer</li>\r\n	<li>&bull; Photographer / Videographer</li>\r\n	<li>&bull; Production coordinator &bull; Director of photography &bull; Gaffer/ Assistants</li>\r\n	<li>&nbsp;Eloader</li>\r\n	<li>Narrative Development and Scriptwriting:</li>\r\n	<li>Video one: Teaser video</li>\r\n	<li>Video two: What is a Consulate and why a new Consulate Compound?</li>\r\n	<li>Video Three: History of the U.S. presence in Casablanca</li>\r\n	<li>&nbsp;Video Four: Building the New Consulate Compound</li>\r\n	<li>Video Five: Designing the New Consulate Compound&nbsp;</li>\r\n	<li>Video Six: Consular Services</li>\r\n	<li>Video Seven: Foreign Commercial Service</li>\r\n	<li>Video Eight: The Overseas Security Advisory Council</li>\r\n	<li>Video Nine: Dar America</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n',0),(1015,428,104,6,0,5000,30000,'day','Camera & Lighting Equipment','<p>&bull; Camera 4K + Prime Lenses include all accessories &bull; Monitoring + wireless video<br />\r\n&bull; 4&nbsp;Lighting Aputure 1200 D<br />\r\n&bull; 4&nbsp;Lighting Aputure 600</p>\r\n\r\n<p>&bull; 3&nbsp;Lighting Nova P300C &bull; Lighting Amaran F22C</p>\r\n\r\n<p>&bull; studio flashes</p>\r\n',1),(1016,428,53,2,0,11000,22000,'day','Post production','<ul>\r\n	<li>Editing include licensee music + text &amp; info graphics if any</li>\r\n	<li>Video Editing and Motion Graphics (for 9 videos)</li>\r\n	<li>Grading &amp; retouching</li>\r\n	<li>Final Rendering in Various Formats</li>\r\n	<li>Voice Over and Subtitling</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n',2),(1017,428,105,2,0,10000,20000,'day','Drone','<ul>\r\n	<li>Drone Permits and Licenses</li>\r\n	<li>Drone video shots&nbsp;</li>\r\n	<li>DroneVideography</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n',3),(1018,429,74,1,0,1200,1200,'day_man','Certificat Ssl','<p>Installation et mise en place du certificat SSL</p>\r\n',0),(1019,430,74,1,0,1200,1200,'day_man','Certificat Ssl','<p>Installation et mise en place du certificat SSL</p>\r\n',0),(1020,431,74,1,0,1200,1200,'day_man','Certificat Ssl','<p>Installation et